{"headword":"אָדָם","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:27\" href=\"/Genesis.1.27\">Gn 1:27</a> <strong>man, mankind (</strong>Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">אדם</span>, Sab. <em>id.</em>, CIS<sup>iv. 1, 1. 4</sup> al.; cf. As. <em>admu</em>, <em>young</em> (of bird) Dl<sup>W</sup>, but Nö<sup>ZMG 1886, 722</sup> identif. with Ar. <span dir=\"rtl\">أَذَامٌ</span> coll. <em>creatures</em><strong>)</strong>—Sg. abs. exc. cstr. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.12\">Pr 6:12</a> cf. Thes; (<span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי</span> (<span dir=\"rtl\">הָ</span>)<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> oft. = pl. of <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:5\" href=\"/Genesis.11.5\">Gn 11:5</a> + 39 textual, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנוֹת הָא׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:2\" href=\"/Genesis.6.2\">Gn 6:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:4\" href=\"/Genesis.6.4\">4</a>)—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>a man</em> (= Ger. <em>Mensch</em>) = human being <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:5\" href=\"/Genesis.2.5\">Gn 2:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:7\" href=\"/Genesis.2.7\">7</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:8\" href=\"/Genesis.2.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:15\" href=\"/Genesis.2.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:16\" href=\"/Genesis.2.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:18\" href=\"/Genesis.2.18\">18</a> +, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:12\" href=\"/Genesis.16.12\">16:12</a> (27 textual J) <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.4\">Lv 5:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶפֶשׁ</span>) <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.2\">13:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.9\">9</a> (19 textual P) <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.10\">Ne 2:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.12\">Is 13:12</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱנוֹשׁ</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">הָאָ׳ הַגָּדוֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 14:15\" href=\"/Joshua.14.15\">Jos 14:15</a